SUMMARY:[Stanford BeWell / Stanford Healthy Living] From Mindset to Motion
  (August 3 - 17)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260803T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260803T131500
DTSTAMP:20260731T151955Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-52901301529260-52901301530287@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Are you eager to create a clearer vision of how you want to li
 ve and work – and a roadmap to help make it happen?\n\nJoin this three-s
 ession online course that will introduce you to straightforward ways to re
 flect\, identify what you want\, and implement your goals so you can move 
 toward the personal and professional life you want. This interactive and e
 ngaging class series will include research-based inquiry\, small group bre
